# Original iPhone photos (24 Nov 2026). These carry EXIF GPS — the exact
# location the shot was taken — and this repo is PUBLIC and the live webroot,
# so committing one publishes that location. Only the stripped, resized
# web derivatives (img/roast-levels/*, *-2.webp, *-2.jpg, …) go in git.
img/CoffeeBeans_RoastingLevel.jpeg
img/buy-coffee-beans-online-malaysia.jpeg
img/how-to-read-flavour-notes.JPG
img/Girl-bought-coffee-from-the-beans-hub.jpeg

# Camera originals behind the iced-latte page (untracked 24 Nov 2026). These
# are the full-size iPhone source shots + a 17MB .MOV that the hero crops were
# made from — no page references them, so they were 31MB of dead weight in a
# public webroot, and they shipped with EXIF/QuickTime GPS. Only the derived
# img/iced-latte/iced-latte-hero-*.jpg are real site assets. Pattern, not exact
# names, so the next camera original can't slip through either.
img/iced-latte/TheBeansHub-*
